# deterministic contact integration fixture, not production packing
plugin load ${slurry_plugin}
units si
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style ellipsoid
atom_modify map array
read_data particles.data
comm_modify vel yes
pair_style zero 3.9999999999999998e-06
pair_coeff * *
neighbor 7.9999999999999996e-07 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
timestep 4.9999999999999998e-07
fix shear all deform 0 xz erate 100 remap v units box
fix hydro all slurry/bridge .01 100 8e-6 .001 .3 contact 10 .24 rolling 10 .24 shape spheroid mobility_backend mesh spectral 2 spectral_tolerance 1e-8 tolerance 1e-6 iterations 1000 history history.csv 1 0
thermo 1
thermo_style custom step time atoms f_hydro[1] f_hydro[2] f_hydro[3] f_hydro[4]
thermo_modify flush yes lost error
run 240
write_data final.data nocoeff
